  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nAn exceptional coastal lifestyle begins with an exceptional location, and this impressive freehold residence delivers both in abundance. Privately positioned just above Mairangi Bay Beach, this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial luxury home in one of the North Shore’s most coveted seaside settings.\r\n\r\nImagine starting your day with a stroll along the beach, coffee at your favourite local café, and the effortless pleasures of a relaxed coastal lifestyle right on your doorstep. Add excellent school zones, a welcoming seaside community and the convenience of nearby amenities, and you have a location that is as desirable as it is enduring.\r\n\r\nDesigned with space, versatility and modern family living in mind, this generous residence offers exceptional accommodation for families of all ages and stages. Six bedrooms, three-plus living areas and a dedicated office provide the freedom to spread out, come together and adapt as family life evolves. Whether accommodating growing children, extended family, visiting guests or working from home, there is room for everyone to enjoy their own space.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, expansive open-plan living creates an inviting setting for everyday family life and effortless entertaining. Generous proportions, a wonderful sense of space and seamless opportunities to connect make this a home equally suited to relaxed weekends and memorable gatherings. Upstairs, the beautiful master suite offers a private retreat, creating a peaceful sanctuary away from the everyday.\r\n\r\nPracticality is every bit as impressive, with a large double garage and additional parking providing valuable space for extra vehicles, the boat and all the beach and boating essentials that come with embracing life by the sea.\r\n\r\nSubstantial, beautifully positioned and offering remarkable flexibility, this is more than a family home, it is an opportunity to secure your place in a premium coastal neighbourhood where the beach, cafés, excellent schooling and a coveted seaside lifestyle are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nA rare combination of position, space and lifestyle, this is Mairangi Bay living at its finest. Your coastal dream starts here.",
